      ":question/problem": "Let $p=⟨1,-2⟩$ and $q=⟨4,-1⟩.$ Find $p\\cdot q.$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Summing up the products of corresponding components, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p\\cdot q & ={p}_{x}\\cdot {q}_{x}+{p}_{y}\\cdot {q}_{y} \\\\  & =1\\cdot 4+(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =4+2 \\\\  & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$"
