      ":question/problem": "If $a=⟨5,1⟩$ and $b=⟨2,4⟩,$ then $a\\cdot b=${{field-1}}.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Summing up the products of corresponding components, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & ={a}_{x}\\cdot {b}_{x}+{a}_{y}\\cdot {b}_{y} \\\\  & =5\\cdot 2+1\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =10+4 \\\\  & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
