      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-317911",
      ":question/problem": "If $u=⟨8,-2⟩$ and $v=⟨3,6⟩,$ then $u\\cdot v=${{field-1}}.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Summing up the products of corresponding components, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\cdot v & ={u}_{x}\\cdot {v}_{x}+{u}_{y}\\cdot {v}_{y} \\\\  & =8\\cdot 3+(-2)\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =24-12 \\\\  & =12.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
